        "preComments": [
          "// Pins a Show baseline with an exception list. Everything the program draws",
          "// stays visible except the boss, so the view's artifact must carry the boss in",
          "// hide_ids and leave show_ids empty. That split is what a consumer reads, and",
          "// the artifact graph snapshot is where it is pinned: the author writes one",
          "// exception list, and which of the two artifact lists it lands in is decided by",
          "// the baseline."
        ],
